Subject: [PATCH] chore(skills): regenerate worktree scorecard after clean
 safety docs

The scorecard freshness gate (test/skill-eval.test.js) recomputes each card from
the SKILL.md source, so documenting what `forge clean` will never reap requires
regenerating the canonical card and its .agents mirror.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .agents/skills/worktree/evals/scorecard.json | 4 ++--
 skills/worktree/evals/scorecard.json         | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.agents/skills/worktree/evals/scorecard.json b/.agents/skills/worktree/evals/scorecard.json
index 981a39b4..866a44a2 100644
--- a/.agents/skills/worktree/evals/scorecard.json
+++ b/.agents/skills/worktree/evals/scorecard.json
@@ -4,8 +4,8 @@
   "static": {
     "token_cost": {
       "desc_chars": 1013,
-      "body_lines": 70,
-      "score": 44
+      "body_lines": 75,
+      "score": 43
     },
     "caps": {
       "desc_within": true,
